<title>USA: Pittston Brink's Group shr rises to $0.41.</title>
<headline>Pittston Brink's Group shr rises to $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.41		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net			 15,841		   14,613</p>
<p> Revs		     232,022		  208,958</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,264		   37,916</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.09		    $0.95</p>
<p> Net			 41,714		   36,124</p>
<p> Revs		     666,637		  573,964</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,158		   37,914</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Included in third quarter results are pretax expenses of $1 million or $0.02 per share for the relocation of of Pittston's corporate headquarters to Virginia in September. 1995 third quarter benefited from a lower than normal quarterly tax rate.</p>
</text>
